00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:29,800
But the profits here are actually coming from those ongoing syrup purchases because they're a little bit more expensive, they have a higher margin locked into them.

116
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:34,440
So let's, so let's finish this up by looking at why these strategies work.

