00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:39,240
And quite simply, we have these as why they work here.

118
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:43,240
Customers do reveal their value through their choice and usage.

119
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:50,600
So their own willingness to pay is going to help us understand how much the consumer actually wants to consume for us.

120
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:55,920
Pricing strategies help firms segment invisibly Again, indirect price discrimination.

121
00:12:55,920 --> 00:12:58,760
We don't know what kind of consumers we have.

122
00:12:59,280 --> 00:13:03,400
And so through these particular strategies, we don't have to worry about that.

